5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 露西亚之血永存！.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/9c/9hnoid9u64w0lj5fyypdm1sed5k73yn.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E9%9C%B2%E8%A5%BF%E4%BA%9A%E4%B9%8B%E8%A1%80%E6%B0%B8%E5%AD%98%EF%BC%81.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/9c/9hnoid9u64w0lj5fyypdm1sed5k73yn.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E9%9C%B2%E8%A5%BF%E4%BA%9A%E4%B9%8B%E8%A1%80%E6%B0%B8%E5%AD%98%EF%BC%81.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/9c/9hnoid9u64w0lj5fyypdm1sed5k73yn.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />露西亚之血永存！\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>近战、对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-1\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓8-↑4\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>5*3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（魔法伤害）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"武技\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">武技</font></span></span>]，单体攻击，消耗<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>点[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"狮血\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">狮血</font></span></span>]，造成<font color=\"#d68fe2\">140%</font>伤害；攻击前攻击提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">40%</font>，并对主目标施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼魔防3\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▼魔防3</font></span></span>]，持续2回合。进行追击，再对主目标所在的<font color=\"#ed7950\">5*3</font>区域内所有敌人造成<font color=\"#d68fe2\">40%</font>范围伤害（不含[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"物品\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">物品</font></span></span>]）<br />\n✦若主目标拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"自然守护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">自然守护</font></span></span>]，则攻击后使其[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"守护失效\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">守护失效</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-1 5*3.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d7/enshzofjw5pzqt5qlj2yez3nni3t2ja.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-1_5%2A3.png.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"77\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d7/enshzofjw5pzqt5qlj2yez3nni3t2ja.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-1_5%2A3.png.jpeg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d7/enshzofjw5pzqt5qlj2yez3nni3t2ja.png/160px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-1_5%2A3.png.jpeg 2x\" data-file-width=\"186\" data-file-height=\"180\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n